efficiency analysis', 'Conduct energy audits in homes, public buildings or enterprises to identify inefficiencies and recommend upgrades.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TVET_006', 'TVET', 'Energy auditing and efficiency analysis', 'Use basic tools and software to calculate energy loads, cost-effectiveness and system performance.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TVET_007', 'TVET', 'Business and project planning', 'Develop business plans for clean energy ventures, considering local market dynamics, consumer demand and government policies.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TVET_008', 'TVET', 'Business and project planning', 'Assess the environmental and economic viability of energy projects and prepare professional feasibility reports.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TVET_009', 'TVET', 'Community engagement and social innovation', 'Lead or support clean energy projects for underserved or displaced populations, improving access and reducing reliance on polluting fuels.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TVET_010', 'TVET', 'Community engagement and social innovation', 'Organise training sessions or awareness campaigns on energy conservation and renewable energy benefits.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_001', 'Tertiary education', 'Advanced research and innovation', 'Conduct original research on sustainable energy technologies, infrastructure and socio-economic impacts using interdisciplinary approaches.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_002', 'Tertiary education', 'Advanced research and innovation', 'Develop and test prototypes or system designs such as wind mapping models, heat storage systems or micro-grid configurations.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_003', 'Tertiary education', 'Policy analysis and development', 'Design policy instruments and frameworks that balance environmental sustainability, energy equity and economic growth.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_004', 'Tertiary education', 'Policy analysis and development', 'Evaluate real-world case studies and apply theoretical frameworks to assess policy effectiveness and trade-offs.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_005', 'Tertiary education', 'Data analysis and modelling', 'Use analytical tools and software for climate-energy modelling, lifecycle analysis, environmental impact assessments and pro-poor energy planning.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_006', 'Tertiary education', 'Data analysis and modelling', 'Interpret datasets to inform decision-making on energy efficiency, access and technological deployment.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_007', 'Tertiary education', 'Technology transfer and international collaboration', 'Facilitate the exchange of knowledge and technology between countries and regions, including best practices for clean energy implementation.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_008', 'Tertiary education', 'Technology transfer and international collaboration', 'Design collaborative projects or joint ventures to support innovation and capacity building in sustainable energy.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_009', 'Tertiary education', 'Stakeholder engagement and communication', 'Communicate technical and policy research effectively to diverse stakeholders, including government bodies, industry professionals, local communities and the media.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_010', 'Tertiary education', 'Stakeholder engagement and communication', 'Organise stakeholder dialogues, roundtables or academic-policy forums for inclusive discussions on energy transitions.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_011', 'Tertiary education', 'Green trade and economic strategy', 'Analyse opportunities for green trade, sustainable energy exports and the development of local renewable energy markets.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_TER_012', 'Tertiary education', 'Green trade and economic strategy', 'Develop investment strategies and economic models that support clean energy innovation and entrepreneurship.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_001', 'Adult education', 'Practical energy decision-making', 'Assess the appropriateness of different energy sources for cooking, lighting and heating in local contexts.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_002', 'Adult education', 'Practical energy decision-making', 'Make informed choices about efficient appliances and sustainable energy solutions.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_003', 'Adult education', 'Energy auditing and conservation', 'Conduct basic energy checks in homes, shops or community centres to spot inefficiencies.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_004', 'Adult education', 'Energy auditing and conservation', 'Suggest low-cost, energy-saving improvements (for example insulation, LED lighting, efficient cookstoves).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_005', 'Adult education', 'Installation and maintenance of small-scale systems', 'Install, operate, maintain small solar systems, solar cookers or solar water heaters.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_006', 'Adult education', 'Installation and maintenance of small-scale systems', 'Troubleshoot common issues in household and community energy systems.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_007', 'Adult education', 'Community mobilisation and project implementation', 'Organise and lead small-scale community projects (for example, shared solar lighting, energy-efficient public buildings).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_008', 'Adult education', 'Community mobilisation and project implementation', 'Form groups to assess local energy needs and co-develop practical solutions.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_009', 'Adult education', 'Education and advocacy', 'Facilitate workshops or demonstrations to raise awareness of clean energy and conservation.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_010', 'Adult education', 'Education and advocacy', 'Mobilise neighbours and local leaders to support clean energy programmes and fair energy policies.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG07_ADULT_011', 'Adult education', 'Green entrepreneurship and economic benefits', 'Identify ways to use renewable energy for income generation (for example, solar-powered tools, clean cooking businesses).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG